{"id":"a9b82ac5305584a4","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-zerodeg.md","title":"零度与停机度","display":"df-zerodeg — 零度与停机度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-zerodeg","aliases":["43-df-zerodeg"],"display":"df-zerodeg — 零度与停机度","depends_on":["[[43-df-dstr]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-jump]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.4.1, print pp.14–15 / PDF pp.34–35","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-zerodeg"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-zerodeg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zerodeg — 零度与停机度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0857d6ab104a439b\" href=\"?note=0857d6ab104a439b\" title=\"43-df-dstr\">43-df-dstr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.4.1, print pp.14–15 / PDF pp.34–35"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{deg}\">\\(\\operatorname{deg}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0857d6ab104a439b\" href=\"?note=0857d6ab104a439b\" title=\"43-df-dstr\">43-df-dstr</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 是A的特征函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 为停机集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0:=\\operatorname{deg}(\\varnothing)=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{Computable}(\\chi_A)\\},\\qquad\\mathbf0&#39;:=\\operatorname{deg}(\\varnothing&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf0:=\\operatorname{deg}(\\varnothing)=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{Computable}(\\chi_A)\\},\\qquad\\mathbf0&#39;:=\\operatorname{deg}(\\varnothing&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>零度与degree原子的同名记号是同一构造的复述。最小性来自不查询预言机的算法能在任意预言机上运行。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.4.1, print pp.14–15 / PDF pp.34–35。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-dstr","status":"resolved","id":"0857d6ab104a439b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-dstr]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dstr","status":"resolved","id":"0857d6ab104a439b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{deg}$ 见 [[43-df-dstr]]；$\\chi_A$ 是A的特征函数，$\\varnothing'$ 为停机集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{deg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0:=\\operatorname{deg}(\\varnothing)=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{Computable}(\\chi_A)\\},\\qquad\\mathbf0':=\\operatorname{deg}(\\varnothing').","display":true}],"bytes":1046,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-zerodeg]] — 零度与停机度"}],"outgoing":["0857d6ab104a439b","f357216a7edb035a","b3936ae4c5d2dc79"]}